                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "24672d6f-ab6b-3089-85f6-8b29391535c5",
                        "entry_id": "02ce7eaa-4ce8-3fb0-938d-493acda4bcb7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Épisode, généralement court, d’une série qui est diffusé uniquement sur Internet."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "818b099d-33d0-4d6e-9ca5-57b0fae5b414",
                                "sense_id": "24672d6f-ab6b-3089-85f6-8b29391535c5",
                                "text": "Voici enfin la suite des webisodes dédiés aux Sims 3 : Animaux et Compagnie qui mettent en avant la chanteuse Shy’m accompagné de ce que l’on pourrait appeler un chien, Warhol."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "43fac16c-cfe0-4a8f-9209-40f4dca167d2",
                                "sense_id": "24672d6f-ab6b-3089-85f6-8b29391535c5",
                                "text": "Nous travaillons aussi sur quelque chose que nous appelons des « webisodes », des épisodes diffusés uniquement sur le net, avec une histoire différente pour chacun."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f5a02fed-f5ff-4b07-983b-173437e3df06",
                        "source_entry_id": "02ce7eaa-4ce8-3fb0-938d-493acda4bcb7",
                        "source_sense_id": "24672d6f-ab6b-3089-85f6-8b29391535c5",
                        "target_lang_word": "webisode",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "webisode",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b47e89c-0820-3760-ba52-d880cf0c4f9d",
                                        "entry_id": "98f49472-bffd-3ce4-aa8f-c6495c5d77b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short audio or video presentation on an Internet site."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27c4bbdc-f3d5-4b00-a44f-693a4e10988a",
                                                "sense_id": "1b47e89c-0820-3760-ba52-d880cf0c4f9d",
                                                "text": "2012, J. C. Calciano, quoted in 2012, Suzanne Lyons, Independent Film Producing: The Craft of Low Budget Filmmaking, unnumbered page,\nI've build a fan-base on the Internet to market my movies through my webisodes. I started the webisode a year before my first movie, and within two years, each of my webisodes average between 20,000 to 50,000 views a day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ee71d23-de97-4ab1-93f6-5645b840c17b",
                                                "sense_id": "1b47e89c-0820-3760-ba52-d880cf0c4f9d",
                                                "text": "Webisodes such as the '6 beers of separation' described in the IMC Challenge at the start of the chapter are online episodes or chapters of an ongoing story. One of the best early examples is the BMW webisode where well-known people such as Guy Ritchie tell engaging stories involving BMW cars."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d58628d5-c2ee-307a-99e7-63cb832cedb7",
                                        "entry_id": "98f49472-bffd-3ce4-aa8f-c6495c5d77b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An episode of an Internet-based movie etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f255b3a-b814-44c3-bd70-86141f53c807",
                                                "sense_id": "d58628d5-c2ee-307a-99e7-63cb832cedb7",
                                                "text": "With the pilot webisode Fault Effect done and the additional character concepts prepared, it was time to start laying the groundwork for the initial batch of future webisodes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11b696c2-4bbc-4a3a-8fca-308e2a65dd30",
                                                "sense_id": "d58628d5-c2ee-307a-99e7-63cb832cedb7",
                                                "text": "Overall, through an analysis of the structure, content, and context of these Web series, this chapter assesses the power of the webisode as a tool for the expression of Black voices, as empowerment for Black creative forces, and as a potential site for creating Black community."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76d56908-6760-3275-9a22-c4d7fe6252b4",
                                        "entry_id": "98f49472-bffd-3ce4-aa8f-c6495c5d77b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An episode of a television show that is only aired online."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d65476f-2b98-4bed-8f18-77823850a456",
                                                "sense_id": "76d56908-6760-3275-9a22-c4d7fe6252b4",
                                                "text": "n most cases, what was referred to as an episode or a webisode wasn't even a complete scene but instead an unfinished thought. A typical Seventh Portal webisode would set up its characters and present a conflict. Then, just as the conflict arose, the webisode reached its designated time limit and the audience was left hanging, rubbing its collective head and wondering, what the heck was that?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a112951c-3f72-4e9e-b378-88578b63181e",
                                                "sense_id": "76d56908-6760-3275-9a22-c4d7fe6252b4",
                                                "text": "The webisodes made clear: Jammer betrayed the Resistance.[…]The webisodes reveal not only character details, but aspects of the narrative arc of the series as well. In Webisode Five, Viper pilot and new husband Duck cries when his wife is killed in a Cylon raid on New Caprica."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
